## Tracking progress

- Before starting, mark the bean as in progress: `beans update {{ .Bean.ID }} --status in-progress`
- As you complete checklist items (`- [ ]`) in the description, tick them off (`- [x]`) by editing the bean file (`{{ .Bean.Path }}` in the beans directory).
